# Continue the current CinderDeep game

Use main and projects/cinderdeep-3d. Read ../../ACTIVE_VERSION.json, ../../VERSION_HISTORY.md,
AGENTS.md and LOCAL_AI_GUIDE.md. Run python3 ../../tools/check_active_version.py.
The game already exists. Preserve its code, models, assets, saves and local work.
Do not recreate it from an empty source tree or continue an archived branch.
Keep the CDC-V8 gameplay rules and Three.js/GSAP architecture. Do not initialize upstream submodules.
